 "summary": "Berner's IntelliSwitch Gen 5 air-curtain control exposes a small Modbus map over RS-485 (RTU or ASCII) and Ethernet/Wi-Fi (TCP). Input registers report door temperature, door switch, heater and motor state, E-stop lock and error codes; holding registers set mode (including a BMS mode), fan speed, target temperature, delays and BMS calls for heat and fan.",
