  "enable": "The document points to the IntelliSwitch Gen 5 Quick Start Guide or the Berner app for Ethernet setup; it does not say where the serial settings are made.",
  "watchdog": "The serial settings include a timeout of 1-999 s; the document does not say what it does.",
  "quirks": [
   "Input and holding registers do not share addresses, by design.",
   "Temperatures exist in both °C and °F registers."
  ],
  "setup": [
   "RS-485 for RTU/ASCII; Ethernet or Wi-Fi for TCP (DHCP by default)."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
   "While E-stop locked (input 11) is 1, mode and the BMS call registers are forced to 0 and read-only."
  ]
